# Technic Hub motor bench: the LEGO Powered Up blocks (legopoweredup) turn the Technic large motor on
# port A one full turn, wait, and turn it back. Press ⇦ To blocks, then Run in the Robot Lab tab: the
# blocks connect to the Lab's Technic Hub as they would to a real one (docs/SIM-LAB.md).
WHEN flag clicked:
  pup set motor A power to 50 %
  pup set motor A stop action to brake
  pup turn motor A on for 360 degrees
  wait 1 seconds
  pup set motor A direction to backward
  pup turn motor A on for 360 degrees
